          "detail": "Both changed pod-template env values are redacted, so the diff alone cannot prove the release carries normal settings. Fault drills use DEMO_STARTUP_FAIL=true and DEMO_ERROR_RATE=1; shipping either would degrade the demo. Require the rendered manifest to show normal values before sync.",
